Mutant: fix-nf2-key-unicode-escape-222
Kind: fix
Since: 2.2.2
Version-note: the 2.2.2 generator, which fixed NF2 itself (SymbolDisplay.FormatLiteral); fix-nf2-key-escape emulates that fix on 2.2.1 and older
Removes: NF2
Why: Another correct form of the [Shared] key literal (a check against false defects, not a proposal for the package): every control, non-ASCII, quote and backslash character as a \uXXXX escape instead of SymbolDisplay.FormatLiteral. The key is the same string, so nothing may appear (NF2 stays absent).

diff --git a/KenseiECS.Generators/SystemInjectionGenerator.cs b/KenseiECS.Generators/SystemInjectionGenerator.cs
--- a/KenseiECS.Generators/SystemInjectionGenerator.cs
+++ b/KenseiECS.Generators/SystemInjectionGenerator.cs
@@ -989,7 +989,7 @@
                         continue;
                     }
                     string key = shared.ConstructorArguments.Length > 0 && shared.ConstructorArguments[0].Value is string s
-                        ? SymbolDisplay.FormatLiteral(s, quote: true)
+                        ? "\"" + string.Concat(s.Select(ch => ch < 0x20 || ch > 0x7e || ch == '"' || ch == '\\' ? "\\u" + ((int)ch).ToString("x4") : ch.ToString())) + "\""
                         : null;
                     string typeName = field.Type.ToDisplayString(Qualified);
                     lines.Add(key == null
